<title>UK: GKN shares seen sharply lower in pre-market.</title>
<headline>GKN shares seen sharply lower in pre-market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in engineering group GKN Plc were expected to be marked sharply lower in pre-market trade on Friday, after the company was awarded record damages of $601 million against it.</p>
</text>
